# Sixteen runs of `curl` on a machine of 128 MiB (`make test-apps`, its
# second run). Each run of a program from the volume must give back its
# image: a duplicate of the image's memory object that `posix_child::load`
# kept made each `curl` (6.7 MiB) cost the shell's job for good, and the
# ninth run here failed (TASK-27 9a item 2).
